      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.23,
      "end_seconds": 74.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.31,
      "end_seconds": 104.89,
      "duration_seconds": 28.58,
      "text": "I'd say moderate. Okay, so I've been looking pale too. And I've been getting out of breath on the stairs as well. As for getting out of breath on the stairs, it's a couple of times a week. I, I did have craving ice at one point, um, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.51,
      "end_seconds": 129.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.82,
      "end_seconds": 134.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Aspirin. I take it 75 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 136.03,
      "end_seconds": 146.03,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Doctor, uh, I think the last prescription for the aspirin was 150 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.15,
      "end_seconds": 153.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I see. Is the most recent prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.35,
      "end_seconds": 168.38,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "no, uh, I left it at home i take Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma. A multivitamin, daily it's the not knowing that gets to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.18,
      "end_seconds": 179.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.09,
      "end_seconds": 183.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Right, no, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.9,
      "end_seconds": 186.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "so, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.1,
      "end_seconds": 192.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "oh, nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.06,
      "end_seconds": 198.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.77,
      "end_seconds": 216.45,
      "duration_seconds": 16.68,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I grab fast food at lunch most days. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.54,
      "end_seconds": 221.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.63,
      "end_seconds": 228.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "My mother has an underactive thyroid. My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.26,
      "end_seconds": 237.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions. I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.59,
      "end_seconds": 251.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "I have heart disease, for nearly five years. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. I've had asthma for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.33,
      "end_seconds": 254.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "ah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.11,
      "end_seconds": 258.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I have thin bones"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.17,
      "end_seconds": 267.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "yes, heart disease and thin bones are known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.62,
      "end_seconds": 288.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any black stools, weight loss or heavy periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.58,
      "end_seconds": 293.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.94,
      "end_seconds": 296.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.81,
      "end_seconds": 303.54,
