      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.51,
      "end_seconds": 312.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.16,
      "end_seconds": 331.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "your inner eyelids look pale and your pulse is a a little fast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.25,
      "end_seconds": 337.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.92,
      "end_seconds": 367.57,
      "duration_seconds": 20.65,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, I don't have a clear answer today: tiredness probably from low iron is possible, and so is an underactive thyroid. So, to recap quickly. You've been feeling tired all the time, moderate, and no heavy periods or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.21,
      "end_seconds": 369.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.8,
      "end_seconds": 375.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "let's book a full blood count to look into tiredness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.37,
      "end_seconds": 378.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "right, understood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.33,
      "end_seconds": 417.61,
      "duration_seconds": 35.28,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an iron study for pallor that will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step for this, ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, three months it's for low iron it's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well take the iron with orange juice, not with tea and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.49,
      "end_seconds": 428.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. I'll want another look in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 429.36,
      "end_seconds": 431.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
